<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<office:document xmlns:office="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:office:1.0" xmlns:style="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:style:1.0" xmlns:text="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:text:1.0" xmlns:table="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:table:1.0" xmlns:fo="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:xsl-fo-compatible:1.0" office:mimetype="application/vnd.oasis.opendocument.text" office:version="1.4">
  <office:styles>
    <style:style style:name="Default" style:family="paragraph">
      <style:paragraph-properties fo:margin-top="0cm" fo:margin-bottom="0cm"/>
      <style:text-properties fo:font-size="10pt"/>
    </style:style>
    <style:style style:name="Centered" style:family="paragraph">
      <style:paragraph-properties fo:text-align="center" fo:margin-top="0cm" fo:margin-bottom="0cm"/>
    </style:style>
    <style:style style:name="Title" style:family="paragraph">
      <style:paragraph-properties fo:text-align="center" fo:margin-top="0cm" fo:margin-bottom="0cm"/>
      <style:text-properties fo:font-size="18pt"/>
    </style:style>
    <style:style style:name="PageBreak" style:family="paragraph">
      <style:paragraph-properties fo:break-before="page" fo:margin-top="0cm" fo:margin-bottom="0cm"/>
    </style:style>
  </office:styles>
  <office:automatic-styles>
    <style:page-layout style:name="PageLayout">
      <style:page-layout-properties fo:page-width="21cm" fo:page-height="29.7cm" fo:margin-top="1.6cm" fo:margin-bottom="1.6cm" fo:margin-left="1.3cm" fo:margin-right="1.3cm" style:print-orientation="portrait"/>
    </style:page-layout>
    <style:style style:name="Table" style:family="table"/>
    <style:style style:name="Col" style:family="table-column">
      <style:table-column-properties style:column-width="4cm"/>
    </style:style>
    <style:style style:name="Cell" style:family="table-cell">
      <style:table-cell-properties fo:border="0.5pt solid #000000" fo:padding="0.05cm" style:vertical-align="middle"/>
    </style:style>
    <style:style style:name="CellTop" style:family="table-cell">
      <style:table-cell-properties fo:border="0.5pt solid #000000" fo:padding="0.05cm" style:vertical-align="top"/>
    </style:style>
    <style:style style:name="Red" style:family="text">
      <style:text-properties fo:color="#ff0000"/>
    </style:style>
  </office:automatic-styles>
  <office:master-styles>
    <style:master-page style:name="Standard" style:page-layout-name="PageLayout"/>
  </office:master-styles>
  <office:body>
    <office:text>
      <text:p text:style-name="PageBreak"/>
      <text:p text:style-name="Title">新北市市有非公用不動產逾予出租過戶申請書</text:p>
      <table:table table:name="申請書第一頁" table:style-name="Table">
        <table:table-column table:style-name="Col" table:number-columns-repeated="4"/>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>受理機關</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p>新北市政府○○局</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>收件日期　年　月　日</text:p></table:table-cell>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>申請人</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>過戶承租原因</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>姓名、身分證統一編號</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>出生日期　年　月　日</text:p></table:table-cell>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>過戶承租人</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>原承租人</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>戶籍地址</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>通訊住址　□同上戶籍地址</text:p></table:table-cell>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>姓名、身分證統一編號</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>出生日期　年　月　日</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>電話</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>姓名、身分證統一編號</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>出生日期　年　月　日</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>地址</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>電話</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>年　月　日</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>電話</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>申請事項</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>承諾事項</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="CellTop" table:number-columns-spanned="2">
            <text:p>1、 本案不動產之申租經受理收件，申請人申租之表示僅為「要約之引誘」，絕不據此認為受理機關已為要約或承諾之表示。</text:p>
            <text:p>2、 附繳證件（含切結事項）絕無虛偽不實，如訂約後經出租機關發現虛偽不實情事者，除願負法律責任外，並無條件同意出租機關撤銷或終止租約，所繳租金及歷年使用補償金不予退還，絕無異議。</text:p>
            <text:p>3、 本人同意依個人資料保護法第15條規定，基於市有財產管理之特定目的，於必要範圍內蒐集或處理申請人之個人資料，並依同法第16條規定，於執行職務為必要之利用。</text:p>
            <text:p>4、 以上承諾事項無誤。</text:p>
            <text:p text:style-name="Centered">原承租人　　　　過戶承租人</text:p>
            <text:p text:style-name="Centered">(蓋原租約印章或印鑑章)　　　　　　　　(蓋章)</text:p>
          </table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
      </table:table>
      <text:p>申請案件編碼：020602　公告期限：14天</text:p>
      <text:p text:style-name="Centered">(民)財非公03-(民)表一-1/3</text:p>

      <text:p text:style-name="PageBreak"/>
      <table:table table:name="申請書第二頁" table:style-name="Table">
        <table:table-column table:style-name="Col" table:number-columns-repeated="4"/>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>申請優惠事項</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="CellTop">
            <text:p>□　1.申請承租人本人適用自用住宅優惠租金</text:p>
            <text:p>□　2.申請身心障礙者或其配偶自用住宅優惠租金</text:p>
            <text:p>□　3.申請低收入戶或領有中低收入老人生活津貼者，承租自住租金優惠</text:p>
            <text:p>□　4.申請現役軍人及其家屬承租自住優惠租金</text:p>
            <text:p>□　5.申請作騎樓通行優惠租金</text:p>
          </table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="CellTop" table:number-columns-spanned="2">
            <text:p>本案承租之市有非公用土地，地上房屋確係作自用住宅使用，絕無出租或營業使用，如有不實，租金優惠原因即消滅，承租人願無條件自適用租金優惠之原因消滅發生日 起按全額繳納租金，並補繳租金差額，絕無異議。</text:p>
            <text:p text:style-name="Centered">過戶承租人（蓋章）　□</text:p>
          </table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>申請標的</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>□ 土地</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>市</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>區</text:p></table:table-cell>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>段</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>小段</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>地號</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>登記面積（平方公尺）　過戶承租面積（平方公尺）</text:p></table:table-cell>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>地上建物門牌</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>市　區　街/路　段　巷　弄　號</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>□ 房屋</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>市　區　街/路　段　巷　弄　號</text:p></table:table-cell>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>主建物面積（平方公尺）</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>附屬建物面積（平方公尺）</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"/>
        </table:table-row>
      </table:table>
      <text:p>申（附繳證件詳背面）</text:p>
      <text:p>申請案件編碼：020602　公告期限：14天</text:p>
      <text:p text:style-name="Centered">(民)財非公03-(民)表一-2/3</text:p>

      <text:p text:style-name="PageBreak"/>
      <text:p text:style-name="Title">附繳證件一覽表</text:p>
      <table:table table:name="附繳證件一覽表" table:style-name="Table">
        <table:table-column table:style-name="Col"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="Col"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="Col"/>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>編號</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>證件名稱</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>核發機關</text:p></table:table-cell>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>1</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="CellTop">
            <text:p>申請人（過戶承租人、原承租人）身分證明文件（以下任繳一種）：</text:p>
            <text:p>（1）身分證影本或戶口名簿影本或戶籍謄本（得由受理機關自行查證）。</text:p>
            <text:p>（2）法人登記證明文件影本及其代表人資格證明影本。</text:p>
            <text:p>（3）法人設立或變更登記表影本。</text:p>
            <text:p>（4）主管機關立案或核備文件影本。</text:p>
          </table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>自備</text:p></table:table-cell>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>2</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>地上建物買賣契約或贈與契約或法院產權移轉證明書及契稅繳款書 影本。</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>自備</text:p></table:table-cell>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>3</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>出租機關放棄優先承購通知書影本（贈與除外）。</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>出租機關</text:p></table:table-cell>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>4</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>最近一期原租賃契約書（租約遺失時，改附切結書及印鑑證明）。</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>自備</text:p></table:table-cell>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>5</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>土地登記謄本（為簡政便民，本市境內得由受理機關自行查證）。</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>地政事務所</text:p></table:table-cell>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>6</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>地籍圖謄本（為簡政便民，本市境內得由受理機關自行查證）。</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>地政事務所</text:p></table:table-cell>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>7</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>部分過戶承租者應附租用位置圖（以地政機關地籍圖謄本繪製）。</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>地政事務所</text:p></table:table-cell>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>8</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p><text:span text:style-name="Red">非屬公職人員利益衝突迴避法不得交易之公職人員或其關係人切結書。</text:span></text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p><text:span text:style-name="Red">自備</text:span></text:p></table:table-cell>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>9</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="CellTop">
            <text:p>申請租金優惠應檢附文件：（身分證明文件可併同編號1附具）</text:p>
            <text:p>（1）承租人本人申請自用住宅租金優惠：檢附設籍於地上房屋之身分證明文件。</text:p>
            <text:p>（2）身心障礙者或其配偶申請自用住宅租金優惠：檢附設籍於地上房屋之身分證明文件及行政機關核發之身心障礙證明文件（設籍於本市者，可以系統代為查調）。</text:p>
            <text:p>（3）低收入戶或領有中低收入老人生活津貼申請自住房屋租金優惠：檢附設籍於地上房屋之身分證明文件及符合本項資格之證明文件（設籍於本市者，可以系統代為查調）。</text:p>
            <text:p>（4）現役軍人及其家屬申請自住房屋租金優惠：檢附設籍於地上房屋之身分證明文件及現役軍人證明文件。</text:p>
          </table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>自備</text:p></table:table-cell>
        </table:table-row>
      </table:table>
      <text:p>註：1.「收件日期」欄空格，申請人請勿填寫。</text:p>
      <text:p>　　2.以上附繳證件若為影本，應由申請人自行核對及註明「影本與正本相符」並認章。</text:p>
      <text:p>　　3.原承租人需於本申請書承諾事項欄位蓋與原租賃契約相符印章或印鑑章及檢附印鑑證明。</text:p>
      <text:p>申請案件編碼：020602　公告期限：14天</text:p>
      <text:p text:style-name="Centered">(民)財非公03-(民)表一-3/3</text:p>
    </office:text>
  </office:body>
</office:document>